  <h1>Cholera Killed a Third of Them. The Cure Was in the Kitchen.</h1>
  <p class="dek">In 1971, ten million refugees crossed into India and cholera killed a third of the people it reached. A doctor with no IV fluid left reached for the kitchen.</p>
